  "In the Wasel.ma system, a strategist agent runs every Monday, synthesizing the brand brief, live data (Search Console, last week's results, competitor moves) and market trends into a weekly brief that a human approves on Telegram before execution.": 1,
  "In the Wasel.ma system, agents do not call each other; they read and write Markdown files (BRAND_BRIEF.md, CAMPAIGN_BRIEF.md, RESULTS.md, SEO_REPORT.md, CRM.md) in a shared Obsidian vault, which serves as the audit trail and limits what a compromised agent can see.": 1,
  "In the Wasel.ma system, final publishing and email sending require human validation via Telegram, and a mailer agent auto-replies to FAQ/pricing questions while escalating hot leads and demo requests to a human.": 1,
  "Opuslon built a three-agent sequential system for the marketing agency Wasel.ma, where each agent receives the previous agent's output and has access only to the data its role needs (CRM, analytics, client drive).": 1,
